# NexusForge Environment Configuration

This file contains the environment variables required for NexusForge to run.

Copy this file to `.env` and adjust the values to match your environment and preferences.

## Core Application Settings

### API Configuration
```
# API host and port
API_HOST=0.0.0.0
API_PORT=8000

# API environment
# Can be: development, production
API_ENV=development
```

### Server Configuration
```
# Server host and port (also used by docker-compose)
SERVER_HOST=0.0.0.0
SERVER_PORT=8000

# Application settings
MAX_CONCURRENT_WORKERS=2
PROJECT_WORKSPACE_SIZE_LIMIT=1073741824  # 1GB in bytes
DEFAULT_TIMEOUT=3600  # seconds
```

## Database Configuration

### PostgreSQL
```
# PostgreSQL connection string
DATABASE_URL=postgresql://postgres:postgres@postgres:5432/nexusforge

# PostgreSQL settings
POSTGRES_USER=postgres
POSTGRES_PASSWORD=postgres
POSTGRES_DB=nexusforge
POSTGRES_HOST=postgres
POSTGRES_PORT=5432

# Connection pool settings
DATABASE_POOL_SIZE=10
DATABASE_MAX_OVERFLOW=20
DATABASE_POOL_TIMEOUT=30
```

### Redis
```
# Redis connection URL
REDIS_URL=redis://redis:6379/0

# Redis settings
REDIS_HOST=redis
REDIS_PORT=6379
REDIS_DB=0
REDIS_PASSWORD=

# Queue configuration
TASK_QUEUE_NAME=task_queue
STATUS_QUEUE_NAME=status_updates
EVENTS_CHANNEL=task_events

# Cache settings
CACHE_TTL=300  # seconds
```

## Security Configuration

### Authentication
```
# JWT configuration
JWT_SECRET_KEY=your-secret-key-change-this-in-production
JWT_ACCESS_TOKEN_EXPIRE_MINUTES=60
JWT_REFRESH_TOKEN_EXPIRE_DAYS=7

# Password hashing
BCRYPT_ROUNDS=12

# Rate limiting
RATE_LIMIT_PER_MINUTE=60
RATE_LIMIT_PER_HOUR=1000

# CORS settings
CORS_ORIGINS=http://localhost:3000,http://localhost:8000
CORS_ALLOW_CREDENTIALS=true
```

### Authorization
```
# RBAC configuration
DEFAULT_USER_ROLE=user
DEFAULT_ADMIN_ROLE=admin

# Permission levels
PERMISSION_LEVELS=SAFE,LIMITED,PRIVILEGED,DANGEROUS
```

